{"4257650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hell Being", "steam_appid": 4257650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About:</strong><br>Hell Being is a Metroidvania where the player explores  hell as a hell-born-creature, face its challenges and monsters to unlock new powers and find a way out from the injustice  of being born in this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257650/extras/8afcd3cc1028a7ead8f9ece9d32aaef3.poster.avif?t=1788283807\" width=1170 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257650/extras/8afcd3cc1028a7ead8f9ece9d32aaef3.webm?t=1788283807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257650/extras/8afcd3cc1028a7ead8f9ece9d32aaef3.mp4?t=1788283807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides humans and demons, there is a third type of creature in hell: the hell beings. hell-born-creatures. Moved by a injustice feeling and rumors you go in a journey to defeat the fiery beast, that was long time ago imprisioned. In a search by the power that will possibly make you out of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable demonic abilities that allow you to access new areas on the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item discovery, allowing build customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven different regions to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with a variety of enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming chal